<section class="faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="container faq-container">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <span class="badge badge-accent">GOT QUESTIONS?</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Everything you need to know about your DAGMARA™ 20V Chainsaw Kit.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-accordion">
      
      <details class="faq-item" open>
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>How thick of a log or tree branch can it cut?</span>
          {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>The DAGMARA 20V is equipped with a genuine 12-inch (30 cm) guide bar and a high-torque 1000W brushless motor, allowing it to easily cut through logs and limbs up to <strong>30 cm (12 inches)</strong> in diameter in under 8–10 seconds.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>How long does the 20V 4.5Ah battery last?</span>
          {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>The 4.5Ah 15-cell lithium-ion battery provides approximately <strong>45–60 minutes of active cutting time</strong> (over 80–100 cuts through 4-inch limbs) on a single charge. If you have extensive yard maintenance, our <em>Double Battery Deluxe Kit</em> is recommended for uninterrupted continuous operation.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>How high can I reach with the telescopic pole?</span>
          {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>The telescopic extension pole extends your physical reach up to <strong>12 to 15 feet high</strong> (depending on user height) with both feet safely planted on the ground, eliminating the dangerous risk of ladder falls.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Do I need tools to tighten or replace the chain?</span>
          {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>No tools required! The DAGMARA features an innovative tool-free red dial knob. Just turn the knob to loosen the side cover, adjust tension, and lock it back down in seconds without carrying wrenches or screwdrivers into the woods.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>What type of chain oil should I use?</span>
          {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Any standard commercial bar and chain oil or biodegradable chainsaw oil works perfectly in the built-in translucent reservoir tank. Simply fill the tank and the automated oil delivery system will keep the bar and chain lubricated during use.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>What is the 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee &amp; Warranty?</span>
          {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We back every DAGMARA tool with an unconditional <strong>30-Day Money-Back Guarantee</strong>. If you are not 100% satisfied with its power and ease of use, return it for a prompt refund. You also receive a full <strong>2-Year Manufacturer Warranty</strong> covering all motor and mechanical components.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
